Modified for Fly Ask: display pedestal removed, disconnected body/head/wing/leg
parts grouped into rigid animation pivots, hair cards attached to corresponding
body parts, geometry normalized, and transparency settings adjusted for WebGL.
Original textures, UVs, normals, and tangents preserved. Wing flapping, folding,
leg tucking, head turns, and landing are authored application animations.
